    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "A Greeting from the Elder"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "3JN 1-4",
          "content": [
            "3 John 1:1–4"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "1",
          "sid": "2JN 1:1"
        },
        "The elder,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        "To ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " chosen lady and her children, whom I love in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " truth — and not I alone, but also all who know the truth — ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "2",
          "sid": "2JN 1:2"
        },
        "because of the truth that abides in us and will be with us forever:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "3",
          "sid": "2JN 1:3"
        },
        "Grace, mercy, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " peace from God ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " Father and from Jesus Christ, the Son of the Father, will be with us in truth and love."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Walking in the Truth"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "JHN 8:30-47",
          "content": [
            "John 8:30–47"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "4",
          "sid": "2JN 1:4"
        },
        "I was overjoyed to find ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "some"
          ]
        },
        " of your children walking in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " truth, just as the Father has commanded ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "us"
          ]
        },
        ". ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "5",
          "sid": "2JN 1:5"
        },
        "And now I urge you, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "dear"
          ]
        },
        " lady — not as a new commandment to you, but ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "one"
          ]
        },
        " we have had from ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " beginning — that we love one another. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "6",
          "sid": "2JN 1:6"
        },
        "And this is love, that we walk according to His commandments. This is the very commandment you have heard from ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " beginning, that you must walk in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "love"
          ]
        },
        "."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Beware of Deceivers"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "7",
          "sid": "2JN 1:7"
        },
        "For many deceivers have gone out into the world, refusing to confess the coming of Jesus Christ in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " flesh. Any such ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "person "
          ]
        },
        " is the deceiver and the antichrist. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "8",
          "sid": "2JN 1:8"
        },
        "Watch yourselves, so that you do not lose what we have worked for,",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:8 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "NE and WH "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "what you have worked for"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " but ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "that"
          ]
        },
        " you may be fully rewarded. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "9",
          "sid": "2JN 1:9"
        },
        "Anyone who runs ahead without remaining in the teaching of Christ does not have God. Whoever remains in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "His"
          ]
        },
        " teaching has both the Father and the Son."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "10",
          "sid": "2JN 1:10"
        },
        "If anyone comes to you ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "but"
          ]
        },
        " does not bring this teaching, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "do"
          ]
        },
        " not receive him into ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "your"
          ]
        },
        " home ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "or"
          ]
        },
        " even greet him. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "11",
          "sid": "2JN 1:11"
        },
        "Whoever greets ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "such a person"
          ]
        },
        " shares in his evil deeds."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Conclusion"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "3JN 13-14",
          "content": [
            "3 John 1:13–14"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "12",
          "sid": "2JN 1:12"
        },
        "I have many things to write to you, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "but"
          ]
        },
        " I would prefer not ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "to do so"
          ]
        },
        " with paper and ink. Instead, I hope to come and speak with you ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "face"
          ]
        },
        " to ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "face"
          ]
        },
        ",",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:12 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Literally "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "mouth to mouth"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " so that our joy may be complete."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "13",
          "sid": "2JN 1:13"
        },
        "The children of your elect sister send you greetings.",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:13 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "BYZ and TR include "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "Amen."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}